   "releaseNotes": "Do more with Meta AI.\n\n• Get daily briefings and more with scheduled tasks and reminders. \n• Connect your email and calendar for help staying organized.\n• Get in-depth research reports in minutes.\n• Create presentations, quizzes, workout planners, and more.\n\n*Certain Meta AI features are only available in select countries and languages. Some of these features may roll out slowly over time.",
